      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR FLIRT (2) goes very well at the course and distance with two wins and a placing from six starts. Was out of the placings last time (30.39) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing seventh and beaten 10 lengths. Rates on top and should go close. DEMENTIA (7) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 23.38 beating Ritza Rocker. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. NITTY GRITTY (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing eighth (18.72) from Box 3 at Taree Super Track over 300m. Boasts two wins from five starts out of this box. One of the better chances. KARA'S VOGUE (4) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
